      "message": "fix: detect storage operations inside iterator closures in storage_in_loop\n\nExtend SorobanStorageInLoop to use enclosing_loop_or_closure instead\nof enclosing_loop, so it also fires for multi-call closures such as\niterator adapter closures (for_each, map, fold).\n\nSingle-call closures like Option::map are already excluded by\nget_enclosing_loop_or_multi_call_closure.\n\nCloses #5",
